        <item>
            <title>3.25.0</title>
            <pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 14:16:54 +0700</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>238</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.25.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>What's New in 3.25.0</h2><ul></ul><p><strong>New</strong></p><ul><li>The new Financial Statements template names bank, card, mortgage, loan and investment statements by date, bank, account holder and account number.</li></ul><p><strong>Improved</strong></p><ul><li>Sketch files are now named by what their design shows.</li><li>Movie and TV recognition keeps working when the online catalog is busy.</li><li>Client Meeting Notes, Store Orders &amp; Shipping and Travel Bookings are no longer added as new templates. If you already have them, they stay.</li></ul><p><strong>Fixed</strong></p><ul><li>Zush no longer freezes for a moment while it waits for files that are still downloading from iCloud.</li><li>Statistics show the right days when your Mac uses a non-Gregorian calendar, such as Buddhist or Japanese.</li></ul>
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://zushapp.com/releases/Zush-3.25.0.dmg" length="20386636" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="FkwvvS+yrRiNkf1el6OicQnYwalYbexdyS3OAQEBoGjpYIe8EpI9kUkKfJ3956XYlX0dLYO6Zev+HdhOm2BQCw=="/>
